;
; hashlock — the toolchain starter puzzle (HANDOVER T19).
;
; Not a production puzzle; it exists to prove the puzzles/ pipeline end to
; end: .clsp -> compiled CLVM -> committed hex + treehash -> run under the
; consensus VM in tests. The value-holding puzzles (Tree-singleton heartbeat,
; epoch vault) are T20/T22 and build on this toolchain.
;
; Shape: HASH is curried in (becomes part of the puzzle, and therefore the
; puzzle hash). The solution supplies a preimage and a list of conditions.
; Spending requires revealing a preimage whose sha256 equals HASH; on success
; the conditions are returned to the VM, otherwise the spend is aborted.

(mod (HASH preimage conditions)
  (if (= (sha256 preimage) HASH)
      conditions
      (x)  ; wrong preimage -> raise -> spend fails
  )
)
